{"v":4,"catch":"東京之戰！你將加入哪一方：綠軍還是白軍？","desc":"《TOKYO WARS》是NAMCO LIMITED（現Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1996年發行的動作射擊遊戲。\n加入綠軍或白軍的坦克部隊，在逼真的城市街道中展開激戰。\n摧毀敵人或被敵人摧毀——東京之戰，此刻開戰！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-11-06","genres":["街機","動作","射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f8555ab741a126b811fbb77942a51025ce3640a2b15a9e28e7a8fe41830daaf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f57482e874a487c6acaa0cbb755104628fde7070be9455be9798d3f276d30a26.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/31b07811777d7e40ab02388ef98b0196c84736a1eec4b6b2d172eadb5735476c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c97f131dc6267eb8f9dbf2449652a6884cb7001aa3140e4cda9c5fd34717a84.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6a0d0a8087bebe84126fb07c676cbf6064599b7fd3b567f4b9c88fad28d24222.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/345172809567540e8fadf9251ee6ce1d4c01adbf2c61143d227cb7eb8e4b16de.jpg"],"titleId":"010029e024926000","dlc":[]}